 "marks": [
  {
   "d": "2022-02-09",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY21",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "As outlined in the interim announcement, results for the year will reflect a period of lag in replacing revenue due to the slowdown of activities caused by COVID and the withdrawal of NATO troops from Afghanistan.",
   "file": "20220209_RTC_Trading-Update-and-Notice-of-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-03-28",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "This has continued into the current year and is likely to have a material effect on our profitability in the first half of 2022.",
   "file": "20220328_RTC_Final-Results-for-the-year-ended-December-31-2021.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-07-29",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "Although the second half of the year will be affected by the emergence of 'definitely not transitory' higher levels of inflation and increasing interest rates, we are expecting all areas of our business that are currently performing well to continue to do so and the rail business situation to stabilise enabling a return to a more positive trading outcome for that period.",
   "file": "20220729_RTC_RTC-Group-Plc-Interim-Report-2022.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-03-27",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "Following a vastly improved performance in the second half of the year and early signs of a continuation of this trajectory into the early part of this year, I remain cautiously optimistic about our future revenue and profit generation.",
   "file": "20230327_RTC_Final-Results-for-the-year-ended-December-2022.md",
   "gnote": "early signal: first step up in tone"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-07-26",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We remain cautiously confident that our progress will continue in the second half of 2023.",
   "file": "20230726_RTC_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-11-29",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "RTC Group Plc (AIM: RTC.L) is pleased to announce that since June, trading has continued in line with the cautious confidence outlined in the interim report.",
   "file": "20231129_RTC_Trading-update-and-notice-of-results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-03-25",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "However, we remain confident that the investments we have made in our people, systems, workforce, and customers will enable us to capture further profitable business opportunities across the industries and sectors we support.",
   "file": "20240325_RTC_Final-results-for-the-year-ended-31-December-2023.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-06-05",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "\"I am pleased to report that since publication of the 2023 results in March the Company continues to trade on a positive trajectory with trading levels ahead of the same period in 2023.",
   "file": "20240605_RTC_AGM-trading-update.md",
   "gnote": "early signal: first step up in tone"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-07-24",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Despite the broader uncertainties facing the recruitment sector, we remain encouraged and optimistic about our short, medium, and long-term prospects.",
   "file": "20240724_RTC_Interim-Results-for-the-Six-Months-to-30-June-2024.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-11-22",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "RTC Group Plc (AIM: RTC.L) is pleased to announce that since June we have been trading in line with the positive expectations about our short, medium, and long-term prospects set out in our interim statement.",
   "file": "20241122_RTC_Trading-update-and-notice-of-results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2025-03-24",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY25",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "Whilst there are unquestionable concerns clouding the confidence of the broader recruitment sector as we enter 2025, and the impact of rising employment costs through the combination of employer national insurance increases and the new Employment Rights Bill have yet to be fully digested, I remain cautiously optimistic of our prospects as we enter the new financial year.",
   "file": "20250324_RTC_Final-results-for-the-year-ended-31-December-2024.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2025-05-21",
